Description: QuartzFire Application Control daemon
 Inline DPI application identification and per-application / per-category
 allow-block enforcement for QuartzFire (VyOS-based NGFW). Classifies new
 flows with nDPI over NFQUEUE, then offloads the verdict to the conntrack
 mark so established flows stay on the pure-nftables fast path.
 .
 Provides a gRPC introspection API and JSON event stream consumed by the
 QuartzFire WebUI (Application Control: Actions / Policies / Alerts) and the
 qfagent cloud controller.
 .
 Requires libndpi (>= 4.8) installed on the target; see the package docs.
